# The .pkl data files are no longer tracked here: the large ones ride on the
# proteusPy data release as assets (see proteusPy/data_fetch.py) and the small
# ones are ordinary git blobs. Release-asset downloads are unmetered, where a
# single clone of the LFS-tracked database exhausted the whole monthly LFS
# bandwidth quota.
*.whl filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
*.mp4 filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
*.ipynb filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
